There are web agencies across the UK that will happily take on clients in South Wales. Many of them do perfectly capable work. But there's a difference between an agency that works in a region and an agency that's part of it.

NC Digital is based in Merthyr Tydfil. Not a regional office, not a flexible remote arrangement with a Welsh postcode — genuinely here, operating in the same community as most of our clients.

Here's why that matters.

## We Know the Local Search Landscape

Ranking a local business in Google is a different exercise depending on where you are. The competitive landscape in Merthyr Tydfil is not the same as Cardiff, and neither is the same as London. Knowing which search terms are realistic to target, which competitors are established in which areas, and how local search behaves across South Wales is knowledge that comes from working in this market specifically — not from a generic playbook.

When we built SEO campaigns for clients like [IR Energy](/portfolio/ir-energy/) or structured service pages for [K Williams Roofing](/portfolio/k-williams-roofing/), the targeting decisions were informed by real knowledge of how people search for these services in this part of Wales.

## We're Easy to Reach

We're not a support ticket or a queue. When a client based in Merthyr Tydfil needs to get hold of us, they can. We're responsive, we know our clients by name, and we don't pass people between account managers.

For small business owners who want a direct relationship with the people doing the work — rather than a company who subcontracts everything and manages the relationship from a distance — this matters.

## We Have a Stake in the Area

NC Digital exists because South Wales businesses were being underserved by the agency market. Too many tradespeople and local businesses were paying over the odds for underwhelming websites, with no understanding of whether they were getting value, and no clear route to improving their online presence.

We care about whether local businesses succeed online — not abstractly, but because they're our neighbours, our community, and the businesses that make the area work. The [What's On Merthyr Tydfil project](/portfolio/whats-on-merthyr-tydfil/) is a good example of that: a community platform that NC Digital built and continues to manage because it genuinely serves the town.

## Local Doesn't Mean Limited

Being based in Merthyr Tydfil doesn't limit who we work with. We build and manage websites for businesses across South Wales — [Cardiff](/web-design-cardiff/), [Swansea](/web-design-swansea/), [Newport](/web-design-newport/), Caerphilly, the Valleys, and beyond. Website work is remote by nature.

What the local base gives us is genuine knowledge of the region, a commitment to the businesses here, and a reputation that operates on the same scale as our clients — accountable, direct, and invested in results.

## Working with Us

If you're a South Wales business looking for a web agency that understands your market and treats your project with the care it deserves, [get in touch](/contact/). See our [portfolio](/portfolio/) for examples of local projects, or read about [why NC Digital only works with small businesses](/blog/why-nc-digital-works-with-small-businesses/).
